---
// ThankYouCard: Carta de Agradecimiento featuring the close-up portrait photo
---

<section class="thank-you-section fade-in-element">
  <div class="thank-you-container">
    <div class="botanical-top-icon">
      <svg
        width="32"
        height="32"
        viewBox="0 0 24 24"
        fill="none"
        stroke="currentColor"
        stroke-width="1.5"
      >
        <path
          d="M12 21.35l-1.45-1.32C5.4 15.36 2 12.28 2 8.5 2 5.42 4.42 3 7.5 3c1.74 0 3.41.81 4.5 2.09C13.09 3.81 14.76 3 16.5 3 19.58 3 22 5.42 22 8.5c0 3.78-3.4 6.86-8.55 11.54L12 21.35z"
        ></path>
      </svg>
    </div>

    <span class="sub-heading">MENSAJE ESPECIAL</span>
    <h2 class="main-heading">Nuestra Gratitud</h2>

    <div class="gold-divider">
      <div class="gold-divider-diamond"></div>
    </div>

    <!-- Close-up Portrait Photo Frame -->
    <div class="portrait-photo-wrapper">
      <div class="portrait-frame">
        <img
          src="/images/portrait_couple.jpg"
          alt="Jesús Galicia Galicia & Jesica Saray Chavarría Vázquez"
          class="portrait-img"
        />
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="letter-content">
      <p class="letter-greeting">A nuestras queridas familias y amigos:</p>

      <p class="letter-body">
        Hoy iniciamos el capítulo más hermoso de nuestras vidas y no podemos
        imaginar este día sin la presencia de las personas que han llenado
        nuestros corazones de amor, sabiduría y momentos inolvidables.
      </p>

      <p class="letter-body">
        Cada risa compartida, cada consejo en el camino y cada muestra de cariño
        han dejado una huella profunda en nosotros. Gracias por acompañarnos,
        por ser testigos de nuestro amor y por celebrar el comienzo de nuestra
        nueva familia.
      </p>

      <div class="signature-block">
        <span class="signature-tag">Con todo nuestro amor y gratitud,</span>
        <h3 class="signature-names">Jesús & Jesica Saray</h3>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .thank-you-section {
    padding: 20px 16px 50px;
    max-width: 520px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
  }

  .thank-you-container {
    padding: 36px 24px;
    text-align: center;
    background: #faf7f2;
    border: 1px solid #e5dec9;
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
  }

  .botanical-top-icon {
    color: var(--color-wine);
    margin-bottom: 4px;
  }

  .sub-heading {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    letter-spacing: 3px;
    color: var(--color-wine-dark);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .main-heading {
    font-family: var(--font-script);
    font-size: 3.2rem;
    color: var(--color-wine-dark);
    font-weight: 400;
    margin-top: 2px;
  }

  /* Close-up Portrait Frame */
  .portrait-photo-wrapper {
    max-width: 320px;
    margin: 20px auto 24px;
    padding: 6px;
    border: 1px dashed var(--color-wine-pastel);
    border-radius: 160px 160px 20px 20px;
  }

  .portrait-frame {
    width: 100%;
    aspect-ratio: 4/5;
    border-radius: 154px 154px 16px 16px;
    overflow: hidden;
    box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(158, 90, 103, 0.15);
  }

  .portrait-img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    object-position: center 20%;
    display: block;
  }

  .letter-content {
    margin: 20px 0 28px;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .letter-greeting {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #2d2523;
    margin-bottom: 14px;
  }

  .letter-body {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-bottom: 14px;
  }

  .signature-block {
    margin-top: 24px;
    padding-top: 18px;
    border-top: 1px stroke var(--color-wine-pastel);
  }

  .signature-tag {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--color-wine);
  }

  .signature-names {
    font-family: var(--font-script);
    font-size: 2.4rem;
    color: var(--color-wine-dark);
    font-weight: 400;
    margin-top: 4px;
  }

  .wishes-action {
    margin-top: 16px;
  }

  .wishes-btn {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 8px;
    background: #25d366;
    color: #fff;
    text-decoration: none;
    padding: 12px 24px;
    border-radius: 30px;
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
  }

  .wishes-btn:hover {
    background: #1ebe5b;
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    box-shadow: 0 6px 16px rgba(37, 211, 102, 0.3);
  }
</style>
